  {
    "name": "tetra-description",
    "text": "Four non-coplanar, tetrahedral mics provide six time-delay constraints. PL extracts correlation features; PS uses subsample interpolation, least squares and filtering to estimate azimuth and elevation, guiding pan–tilt aiming and directional audio.",
    "x": 460,
    "y": 451,
    "w": 308,
    "h": 110,
    "size": 14.667
  },
  {
    "name": "async-heading",
    "text": "Asynchronous speaker-gated tracking",
    "x": 458,
    "y": 591,
    "w": 314,
    "h": 25,
    "size": 16
  },
  {
    "name": "async-description",
    "text": "A passing score grants a timed permit, so pan–tilt updates need not await each inference. This uses the current direction without guaranteed multi-speaker identity binding.",
    "x": 458,
    "y": 616,
    "w": 315,
    "h": 73,
    "size": 14.667
  },
  {
    "name": "joint-heading",
    "text": "Joint localization, verification\nand pan–tilt operation",
    "x": 948,
    "y": 210,
    "w": 310,
    "h": 38,
    "size": 16
  },
  {
    "name": "test-conditions",
    "text": "48 kHz; direction window: 3 frames, at least 1 valid.\nLevel threshold: 12000 (PCM statistic).",
    "x": 910,
    "y": 406,
    "w": 354,
    "h": 35,
    "size": 12.667
  },
  {
    "name": "joint-result",
    "text": "Both board trials combined localization reads, speaker scoring and pan–tilt commands with runtime fault values of 0. The user observed turning toward sound. This supports joint operation on one platform; commands do not confirm that the mechanism reached each target.",
    "x": 910,
    "y": 448,
    "w": 354,
    "h": 98,
    "size": 14.667
  },
  {
    "name": "test-limitations",
    "text": "Both axes were enabled. The trials used one target template, threshold 0.45 and a 10 s permit. Each run completed 6 speaker evaluations before STOP as direction updates continued. Run 2 dropped 1 old localization result. Angular error, verification accuracy and long-term stability remain unverified.",
    "x": 910,
    "y": 551,
    "w": 354,
    "h": 107,
    "size": 14.667
  },
  {
    "name": "outlook",
    "text": "Next: quantify direction/pointing error; test other speakers, real-mic beamforming and touch; pursue robotic hearing.",
